# H5's evidence on this machine (spec 5.1, AC-6): frames, packages and the raw session events stay
# here and are never committed; each cell's trace (trace.json), the bench's cell record (cell.json),
# the stress the capture used (stress.json) and the judge's answers (judgements*.jsonl) are.
*
!.gitignore
!*/
!*/trace.json
!*/cell.json
!*/stress.json
!judgements*.jsonl
